{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And when you reap.</b> After the acknowledgment for the harvest and its success, He gave warning concerning commandments for the preservation of the wealth acquired through success, and commanded concerning gleanings and the corner, as they said (Ketubot 66b): מֶלַח מָמוֹן חֶסֶר, and some say: חֶסֶד (\"salt of money is lacking\" / \"kindness\")." "<b>I am HaShem your Elohim.</b> Elohim of the reapers and Elohim of the poor who glean the gleanings and the corner — and I will reward those who are good to them, for acting in accordance with My will."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:34.674883643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}